{"unit_id":"ma-pony__deepspider#card-zh","repo":"ma-pony/deepspider","commit":"e53ab8cb85a372f55ebe43a4b408adc8378003f7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSpider 是面向 DSH Web 的浏览器自动化与 JavaScript 逆向工具集。它把 Host、Spider Agent 和 Preset 接入 DSH，为每个 Session 提供独立运行时，并用 Patchright/CDP 采集页面、网络、脚本和运行时证据。主要功能包括浏览器操作、请求与 WebSocket 查看、脚本搜索、调试和 Hook，以及从浏览器证据尝试恢复 Cookie、验证请求和导出 Solver。适合需要检查网页行为或复现 Cookie 逻辑的 DSH 用户。无需额外 API Key；运行 Agent 需要 DSH Web 和 Chromium。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh/agent-plugin.js:8","src/dsh/host-plugin.js:8","src/tools/index.js:10","src/tools/groups/recovery.js:147","src/recovery/default-capabilities.js:57"]}
